---
import { site } from '@/data/site';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<section id="kegiatan" class="section bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface" aria-labelledby="kegiatan-title">
  <div class="section-header">
    <span class="section-label">Rutinitas Harian & Mingguan</span>
    <h2 id="kegiatan-title" class="section-title-md3">Aktivitas & Kegiatan Santri</h2>
    <p class="section-subtext">Didesain untuk membentuk kedisiplinan ibadah, ketajaman intelektual, serta kemandirian santri.</p>
    <div class="section-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- 5 Kartu Ikon Kegiatan -->
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-space-sm">
    <!-- 1. Ibadah Yaumiyyah -->
    <div class="card-surface-low">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary-container text-primary-fixed flex items-center justify-center shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">
        <Icon class="text-[24px]" name="mosque" />
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col min-w-0">
        <h3 class="font-title-md text-title-md text-primary mb-1">Ibadah Yaumiyyah</h3>
        <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          Sholat berjamaah 5 waktu, al-ma'tsurat pagi petang, sholat dhuha, tahajud bersama, shaum sunnah, halaqoh tahfidz Qur'an mutqin, serta pembacaan berzanji/rawi.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 2. Pengembangan Ilmiah & Mentalitas -->
    <div class="card-surface-low">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-secondary-container text-on-secondary-container flex items-center justify-center shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">
        <Icon class="text-[24px]" name="psychology" />
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col min-w-0">
        <h3 class="font-title-md text-title-md text-primary mb-1">Pengembangan Ilmiah & Mentalitas</h3>
        <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          Pengajaran kitab kuning klasik, muhadatsah bahasa Arab, speech bahasa Inggris, forum diskusi ilmiah, kepramukaan santri, keorganisasian, dan praktik kepengajaran.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 3. Intensive Learning -->
    <div class="card-surface-low">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary-container text-primary-fixed flex items-center justify-center shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">
        <Icon class="text-[24px]" name="menu_book" />
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col min-w-0">
        <h3 class="font-title-md text-title-md text-primary mb-1">Intensive Learning / Guided Study</h3>
        <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          Sesi belajar malam rutin secara mandiri dan terbimbing langsung oleh musyrif asrama untuk pengulangan materi sekolah dan mutaba'ah hafalan.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 4. Pelatihan Keterampilan dan Kesenian -->
    <div class="card-surface-low">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-secondary-container text-on-secondary-container flex items-center justify-center shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">
        <Icon class="text-[24px]" name="draw" />
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col min-w-0">
        <h3 class="font-title-md text-title-md text-primary mb-1">Keterampilan & Seni Islami</h3>
        <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          Seni kaligrafi khaththath, latihan pidato muhadhoroh 3 bahasa, marawis, hadroh banjari, seni tata boga mandiri, serta literasi komputer/IT.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 5. Kegiatan Olahraga -->
    <div class="card-surface-low">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary-container text-primary-fixed flex items-center justify-center shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">
        <Icon class="text-[24px]" name="fitness_center" />
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col min-w-0">
        <h3 class="font-title-md text-title-md text-primary mb-1">Kegiatan Olahraga Jasmani</h3>
        <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          Seni bela diri santri, futsal mingguan, sepak bola lapangan, badminton, tenis meja, dan senam kebugaran jasmani pagi santri.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>